{"n":104,"ar":"الهمزة","tr":"Al-Humazah","en":"The Traducer","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"وَيۡلٞ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٖ لُّمَزَةٍ","Waylun likulli humazatin lumazatin","Woe unto every slandering traducer"],[2,"ٱلَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالٗا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","Allathee jamaAAa malan waAAaddadahu","Who hath gathered wealth (of this world) and arranged it"],[3,"يَحۡسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","Yahsabu anna malahu akhladahu","He thinketh that his wealth will render him immortal"],[4,"كَلَّاۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِي ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","Kalla layunbathanna fee alhutamati","Nay, but verily he will be flung to the Consuming One"],[5,"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","Wama adraka ma alhutamatu","Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Consuming One is"],[6,"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","Naru Allahi almooqadatu","(It is) the fire of Allah, kindled"],[7,"ٱلَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","Allatee tattaliAAu AAala alafidati","Which leapeth up over the hearts (of men)"],[8,"إِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِم مُّؤۡصَدَةٞ","lnnaha AAalayhim musadatun","Lo! it is closed in on them"],[9,"فِي عَمَدٖ مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","Fee AAamadin mumaddadatin","In outstretched columns"]]}